{"title": "Mermaid", "pageid": 48590, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Mermaid", "categories": ["Nonexistence"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>A <b>mermaid</b> is an aquatic <a href=\"/wiki/Humanoid\" title=\"Humanoid\">humanoid</a> that is referenced, but does not appear in <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Mentions\">Mentions</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_Father%27s_Diary\" title=\"A Father's Diary\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Book_Tome_Y_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_Y_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/80/Book_Tome_Y_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Tome_Y_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/80/Book_Tome_Y_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Tome_Y_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Book_Tome_Y_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Tome_Y_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/80/Book_Tome_Y_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/A_Father%27s_Diary\" title=\"A Father's Diary\">A Father's Diary</a></span> - <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ulder_Ravengard\" title=\"Ulder Ravengard\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d9/Portrait_Ulder_Ravengard.png/25px-Portrait_Ulder_Ravengard.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d9/Portrait_Ulder_Ravengard.png/38px-Portrait_Ulder_Ravengard.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d9/Portrait_Ulder_Ravengard.png/50px-Portrait_Ulder_Ravengard.png.webp 2x\"><img a